<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是变量吗</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>如果那一圈是固定的，所有人的交付应该差不多</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{height: 330, flexDirection: "row", gap: 14, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 26, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>同一个模型 · 团队 A</Text><Box style={{width: 170, height: 92, background: "rgba(255,255,255,0.55)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "2px solid #0F6E56", marginTop: 14}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 16}}>谁放行、碰得到什么、留下什么记录——都定了。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 56, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 24, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>vs</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 26, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#A32D2D"}}>同一个模型 · 团队 B</Text><Box style={{width: 170, height: 92, background: "rgba(255,255,255,0.55)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "2px dashed #A32D2D", marginTop: 14}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 16}}>同样三件事，边界厚度完全不同。</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 30}}>所以：同一个模型，换一圈，就是两套交付系统。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>20 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
